POST http://localhost:3000/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "make": "Ford",
  "model": "Mustang",
  "year": 2017,
  "mileage": 72000,
  "lng": 45,
  "lat": 45,
  "price": 19000
}

### Approve a report

PATCH http://localhost:3000/reports/7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true
}

### Get all reports

GET http://localhost:3000/reports?make=Ford&model=Mustang&lng=45&lat=45&mileage=20000&year=2016
